# Seed data containing real people's personal details.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. These files carry ~2,200 personal email
# addresses, ~960 phone numbers and ~380 dates of birth belonging to event
# attendees and hackathon participants, none of whom agreed to have them
# published. Committing them once puts them in the git history permanently —
# deleting the file later does not remove them.
#
# The files live in the working copy and are applied to the database directly.
# They must never be tracked here.
supabase/seed/*.sql
supabase/seed/hackathons/*.sql
